<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan 20-day NCDs average yield at 5.825 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan 20-day NCDs average yield at 5.825 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank on Friday issued T$3 billion in 20-day negotiable certificates of deposits at an average yield of 5.825 percent, a central bank official said.</p>
<p>The range of the yields was between 5.800 and 5.849 percent. Demand totalled T$4.5 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
